=begin
  libeo: the shared library for the e-scripts.

  Loaded once per session with Script.loadlib('libeo'); definitions persist after the
  library script exits. Script.loadlib never loads it twice, so a script that needs a newer
  copy than the session holds runs libeo again. Then it names the version it was built
  against and the library refuses a mismatch loudly:

    Script.loadlib('libeo')
    Script.run('libeo') if Gem::Version.new(::EO::VERSION) < Gem::Version.new('0.53.0')
    EO.require('0.53.0')

  This file only loads the library. The library itself is scripts/eo/, one file per
  concern; each file opens with what it holds, and README.md has the list.

        author: elanthia-online
  contributors: Nisugi
          game: Gemstone
          tags: library, utility, eo
      required: Lich >= 5.22.0
       version: 0.53.0

  Version Control:
  Major_change.feature_addition.bugfix
  v0.53.0 (2026-11-14)
    - feature: EO::Loot::Context, what a looting pass reads and keeps: the settings, the stow, the
      hands and containers it works with and where to say something and to save what it learned;
      it learns a crumbly item or a self-closing bag the way eloot does. Nothing uses it yet
  v0.52.1 (2026-11-14)
    - fix: EO::Hands.wear answers :cant when the game says the item cannot be worn; it
      answered :stuck, which a caller takes for a fault
    - fix: EO::Brooch ends its ANALYZE at its last line, the one that says what the brooch is
      restricted to; it waited five seconds on every one for a prompt Lich strips
    - fix: EO::Brooch matches the whisper, rub and ANALYZE lines whole, as the game prints them,
      not by a few words of them
    - fix: EO.command and EO.result send a command again only for "...wait N seconds.", the
      game's answer while the character is in roundtime; a "Roundtime: N sec." line is what a
      command that ran leaves, and is part of its answer, not a reason to send it again
    - fix: EO::Guild::Disablers.target! waits five seconds for TARGET RANDOM's answer, clears
      stale lines, and learns only the hostile names the game refuses
    - fix: EO::Casting.active_on answers nil when SPELL ACTIVE got no answer in time
    - fix: EO::Hands.take chooses the hand that is free and usable; with the right arm crippled
      it dragged to the right hand and waited five seconds
    - fix: EO::Stow#make_room moves a box only between the box bag and the overflow bags, not any
      worn container with room
    - fix: EO::Skinning.tool answers nil when no weapon is listed and the right hand is empty
    - fix: a profile is written through a temporary file; one that cannot be read is moved
      to <name>.bad with a warning and the script starts on its defaults; one bad profile no
      longer stops the others being held; dates, times, ranges and sets are read back
    - fix: the SimuCoin reduction ends in US Eastern time (EO.parse_eastern), not the machine's
    - fix: EO::Guild::Guards takes a guard's rescue and lost-heirloom replies as answers, and
      goes on to the next guard when one does not answer
    - fix: EO::Herbs::Heal.deader ends on an unanswered pour (:timeout) and after 20 passes;
      EO::Herbs::Shop.pour_into pours at most ten times
    - fix: EO::Coordination refuses to settle a receipt too big for one frame
    - fix: libeo install, uninstall and doctor name an unreadable manifest instead of ending
      in a backtrace; install writes the manifest through a temporary file and removes stale
      files only after the copies
